claiming the return of the property, as he had lent it to Hwang Chae Shik for a decade and is now planning to sell it to pay off some debts. Chae Shik had kept this matter a secret from his family and now they must all consider moving out with their limited resources and abandon one of their means of living. However, In Ho disappears without leaving any instructions about the farm. Just when the Hwangs believe they may be able to stay after all, Baek Ja Eun arrives at their door. She's the daughter of the owner and has been left destitute, so she not only needs a place to live, but also money to search for her father. As such, she's planning to sell the farm, throwing the Hwangs into disarray again","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8}],"value":8,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":3673,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}